cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Prüfliste EU AI Act
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as part of the SimpleAct AI Governance Framework."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: SimpleAct-Compliance
repository-code: "https://github.com/SimpleAct-Compliance/simpleact-ai-act-checklist"
license: MIT
abstract: "A review layer for Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 built around a minimum standard for what counts as checked: subject with version, a finding rather than an intention, named evidence, a person who is not the implementer, and a date. Covers the eight review steps in the order they have to be established, the four states an evidence record moves through, why ongoing duties need a series of records rather than a single one, and which obligations are already due under the dates as amended by the Digital Omnibus."
keywords:
  - EU AI Act
  - GDPR
  - compliance checklist
  - evidence register
  - approval states
  - Article 5
  - Article 50
  - Article 6(3)
  - audit readiness
  - SimpleAct
